<span class="p8">2025 Winner: Energico</span><br>
<a href="javascript:writeGallery('Oct. 26, 2025','Kikuka Sho (Japanese St. Leger) (G1)','../en/racing/news_media/gallery/img/2025/s2/251026a.jpg','../en/racing/news_media/gallery/img/2025/b/251026a.jpg')"><img src="../en/racing/news_media/gallery/img/2025/s1/251026a.jpg" width="115" height="75" alt="Kikuka Sho (Japanese St. Leger) (G1)" /></a>
<a href="javascript:writeGallery('Oct. 26, 2025','Kikuka Sho (Japanese St. Leger) (G1)','../en/racing/news_media/gallery/img/2025/s2/251026b.jpg','../en/racing/news_media/gallery/img/2025/b/251026b.jpg')"><img src="../en/racing/news_media/gallery/img/2025/s1/251026b.jpg" width="115" height="75" alt="Kikuka Sho (Japanese St. Leger) (G1)" /></a>
<br><br>


<!--
<span class="p8">2024 Winner: Urban Chic</span><br>
